Nothing[ satisfies a crowd] like a buffet[,] and at The Ridgeline, we have buffet[ catering] options to[ suit every] palate. Our breakfast buffets run the[ gam]ut from The Continental, featuring assorted danishes, turnovers, muffins, and fresh fruit, to the deluxe Big Thompson, which includes pancakes, French toast, ham steaks, and more.[ Lunch] buffet options cover an array of cuisine from around the globe, ranging from the Orient Express to the Taste of Italy to South of the Border. And[ when it comes] to[ dinner] buffets, we[ pull out all] the[ stops]! Just to[ name a] few, you can[ choose] from the Southern Hospitality Buffet, featuring BBQ Ribs, Southern Friend Chicken and Cajun Potato Salad; the Land and Sea Buffet, including Prime Rib with Au Jus and Horseradish, and Honey Pecan[ Gr]illed Salmon; or The Rodeo Buffet, showcasing Chipotle Roasted Pork Loin and Slow-Braised BBQ[ Br]isket.[ Veget]arian options are also available, as well as a variety of a la carte selections[.]
