> The[ latest] in Jazz North East’s series of Sch[m]azz gigs at the Jazz Café featured[ British guitar]ists Mike Walker and Stuart McCallum. All seats in the upstairs room were taken[ (]two of the north east’s finest[ six-string]ers bag[ged prime] seats) and the stage resembled the guitar section of your local[ musical] instrument store. The Greater Manchester-based duo settled down to play the first of two mainly acoustic sets in a setting Walker later described as having ‘a good vibe’.
